Package: antitrustBayes
Title: Bayesian Counterfactual Simulation for Antitrust Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Charles Taragin
Maintainer: Charles Taragin <ctaragin+antitrustr@gmail.com>
Authors@R: c(
    person("Charles", "Taragin",
           email = "ctaragin+antitrustr@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Bayesian estimation of differentiated products demand and supply
    models using 'Stan' via 'rstan', with counterfactual simulation via the
    'antitrust' package. Provides posterior distributions of price effects,
    consumer welfare changes, and other competition metrics. Supports Bayesian model
    averaging and comparison across supply models using bridge sampling,
    WAIC, and LOO-CV.
